{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>動作遊戲《Towaga》讓玩家掌握聖光、驅逐暗影生物，適合喜歡動作與冒險挑戰的玩家；原價 US $2.99，現於 App Store <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-155.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>法術裝備與多重模式</h2>\n<p>玩家可運用聖光驅逐成群暗影生物，在叢林徒步作戰或飛越高峰神殿。遊戲收錄超過 70 個獨特關卡與 4 種模式，並可探索毀滅性法術、強化能力及解鎖新裝備，迎戰黑暗軍團。旅程亦透過神器揭示 Az’Kalar 的神秘過去，配合動畫電影風格畫面與沉浸式配樂，另有排行榜及成就挑戰。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Towaga: Among Shadows</li><li>應用類別：Games</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/towaga-among-shadows/id1637913311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.860848+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T23:59:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:31.315384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:39.540356+00:00","content_hash":"ff92e8bb2938c8e1080a37194996ddddc343ed26d3362c1b81f81ef36dad25f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}